Package: NCRNWater
Type: Package
Title: Data analysis and visualization for NPS I&M water monitoring
Version: 1.0.1
Date: 2026-04-30
Author: John Paul Schmit, Aaron Weed, Kate Miler, Charles Wainright
Maintainer: John Paul Schmit <john_schmit@nps.gov>, Charles Wainright <charles_wainright@nps.gov>
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: This package is designed to analyze and visualize data from the
    National Park Service Inventory and Monitoring Program. Package was originally
    designed for the National Capital Region, and has been expanded to cover the 
    Northeast Temperate Network.
License: Public Domain
